<title>PERU: Peru's Cementos Lima SA 9-mo net rises 2.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Peru's Cementos Lima SA 9-mo net rises 2.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 50.9 million soles vs 49.8 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 260.6 million soles vs 256.9 million soles</p>
<p>NOTES: Cementos Lima SA is Peru's largest cement firm.</p>
<p>Its non-voting labor shares are considered blue chips on the Lima stock exchange.</p>
<p>-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134</p>
</text>
